# HIPAA Compliance Checklist

## Administrative Safeguards

- [x] Designate a Privacy Officer and Security Officer
- [x] Conduct annual risk assessments
- [x] Implement workforce training program
- [x] Establish sanctions policy for violations

## Physical Safeguards

- [x] Implement facility access controls
- [x] Secure workstation use policy
- [x] Device and media controls

## Technical Safeguards

- [x] Access control (unique user IDs, automatic logoff)
- [x] Audit controls (logging and monitoring)
- [x] Integrity controls (data validation)
- [x] Transmission security (encryption)

## Policies and Procedures

- [x] Privacy policies
- [x] Security policies
- [x] Breach notification procedures
- [x] Business Associate Agreements (BAAs)

